  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transparency and Accountability in Papua New Guinea Project (TAP Project)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the project (impact) is to contribute to improve transparency and accountability in the use of public financial resources at the national level in Papa New Guinea (PNG), and particularly in the Autonomous Region of Bougainville&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(13, 13, 13);&quot;&gt;The outcomes are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(13, 13, 13);&quot;&gt;1-&lt;/span&gt;Increased demand for Integrity, Transparency and Accountability (ITA) systems and practices on a national level;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2- &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(13, 13, 13);&quot;&gt;Improved&lt;/span&gt; ITA systems and practices at the pilot subnational level (in Bougainville).&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
